OL,3,GNEWSAFlat owners 'helpless' after
OL,4,Aceilings cave in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she has been left feeling
OL,7,F"helpless" after water started welling
OL,8,Fup beneath the carpets of her newly
OL,9,Fbought flat.
OL,11,FSophie Manfield moved to Portland View
OL,12,Fin Bristol in November and is one of
OL,13,Fseveral leaseholders who said water had
OL,14,Finfiltrated walls throughout the
OL,15,Fbuilding, causing ceilings to cave in
OL,16,Fand mould to grow.
OL,18,FThe problem appears to lie in the roof,
OL,19,Fwhich residents claim was not built to
OL,20,Fthe correct specification by
OL,21,Fdevelopers, Barnett Developments Ltd.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
